Promote action-led Decision Case results UX.

This release responds to live results usability feedback. The generic Evidence status panel is removed from the visible Decision Case because it explains methodology rather than helping the homeowner decide what to do. Key issues is renamed What to do next and each issue now carries a concrete Do this action. The installer-question panel is reframed as Your next action and explicitly tells the homeowner to obtain written answers before paying a deposit.

A direct Send these questions action is added from the next-steps panel, while detailed evidence completeness and quote provenance remain available lower in the result for users who want the supporting detail.

PDF upload support and the existing live Stripe configuration are preserved.

